      question: 'Should we buy hospitality software or build custom?',
      answer: "For most hotels, restaurants and venues, packaged hospitality software (a PMS, POS, booking widget and channel manager) is the right foundation. Custom hospitality software development earns its place around the edges: a direct booking engine that reflects your product, a guest app that ties together stays, dining and activities, integrations between systems that don't talk to each other, or reporting that pulls data from all of them. We will tell you when an existing product already does the job.",
